<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to BlogSpace</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header class="hero">
      <div class="badge">Day 1 Foundation</div>
      <h1>Welcome to BlogSpace</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Your blog platform is being built.</p>
    </header>

    <main class="card">
      <h2>Project Status</h2>
      <p>The Express.js server, EJS view engine, and SQLite database have been successfully initialized.</p>
      
      <div class="checklist-preview">
        <div class="check-item">
          <span class="dot active"></span>
          <span><strong>Day 1:</strong> Setup & Backend Foundation (Completed)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="check-item pending">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span><strong>Days 2–7:</strong> Database Schema, Post Display, CRUD, & UI polish</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> BlogSpace &bull; Built with Node.js & Express</p>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script src="/js/script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
